MAIN
MOVE TEMP 11 12
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 FieldTest_ved_UseFields
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 0
MOVE TEMP 18 TEMP 17
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 0
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 19
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 TEMP 20
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 21 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 21
PRINT TEMP 4
END
FieldTest_ved_UseFields [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 22 10
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 0
MOVE TEMP 23 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 2 4 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 20
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 0
